# bbm-plan keys — copy this file to `.env` next to `bbm_providers.json` and
# fill in the one variable your provider entry names in `env_key`. The skill
# sources it before every run. Never commit a filled .env.
#
# The route itself (endpoint, shape, model) lives in `bbm_providers.json`,
# not here: `--provider NAME` reads the entry, and this file only supplies
# the key that entry points at. Nothing else is read from the environment.

# The example provider file's entries name these:
OPENAI_API_KEY=
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# `BBM_API_KEY` is read for any format when the entry's env_key is unset.
#BBM_API_KEY=

# OrcaRouter needs no entry: `--model orcarouter` routes there and reads this.
#BBM_ORCAROUTER_API_KEY=

# The codex route (`--model codex`) uses no key at all — `codex login`.
